WEBVTT

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.360
Hey, you!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.990
Minato-<i>senpai</i>! You came!

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:56.910
You're damn annoying,
sending me all these texts.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:01.920
"I'll wait forever. I'm waiting. Still
waiting. You coming? Guess not, huh?

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:07.670
Oh, well... If we can't meet...
I'll see you in the next life."

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:10.420
Don't send stuff I can't ignore.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.890
Sorry! I just had to talk with you.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:15.970
I've got nothing to say.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:18.640
Try out water polo again!

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.730
Give it a rest. I already--

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.020
Doesn't it frustrate you?!

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.440
Huh?

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:36.320
It... frustrates me.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.170
Episode 9:                   I've Always Been Me

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.130
I wonder if he'll convince him...

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.550
Let's hope.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.720
All we can do is wait and believe in Ei.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:26.230
If we don't find someone,
we can't play prefecturals.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:28.850
We need to act quickly.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.320
We sure do.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:39.490
Are you really fine with someone else?

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.370
I want to play with Minato.

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.700
Yeah!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.460
I don't wanna give up on Minato, either.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:52.710
But... he's a different guy now.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:57.130
And he's already refused us
a thousand times, so...

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:01.970
All our expectations
might be tough for him.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.980
Even so, I'm not giving up!

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:10.230
I'll convince Minato-<i>senpai</i>,
no matter what!

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.810
And how's that?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.360
I'm good at crying!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.950
I'll fake cry to reach his heart!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.700
I worry.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.130
It... frustrates me.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.260
It frustrates me not to see
a prodigy like you play!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.100
It frustrates me for it to end like this!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:48.180
It frustrates me, too.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:54.020
Right?! You should be Japan's
best in high school, too!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:59.490
It's a shame if your talent
goes to waste! So, play with us!

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.490
You're right.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.950
You'll play?!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:09.620
No. As the best, it's beneath me
to play with you guys.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.080
Huh?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.920
Don't ask again. You're wasting my time.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:23.430
That's right... I should be Japan's best,
even in high school.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:24.970
Um...!

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:54.370
You're still running home
after practice, huh?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.750
Or do you just have to piss really bad?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.380
What do you want?

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:09.100
Your memory came back?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.220
Yeah.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:15.230
Coach seemed pretty happy about it.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:16.980
Yeah?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:25.990
It must've been nice keeping at
water polo without any worries.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:32.290
You had it good, Momo. With me out
of the picture, you became the ace.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:37.500
I bet you consider yourself
lucky I wasn't around.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:43.170
Yeah. I got to take over
your seat on the throne.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:47.800
Unbelievable! All you ever
did was pass to me!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.850
Well, I've changed!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:54.140
I'm not the same kid
who played beneath you.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:58.560
I've sacrificed a lot. I poured
all my time into water polo!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.070
I'm not the same guy you know!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:09.070
I became an egotist like coach wanted.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.200
You were one, too.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.790
Listen, Kiyomizu. Become our ace.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:19.960
Huh?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.050
You have the talent.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.380
Thanks.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.010
But you're too kind.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.220
Huh?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:33.470
I believe aces have to be egotistical.
They must score, even if it looks selfish.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.520
Hesitate and you miss a chance to shoot.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:37.850
Yeah...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.520
We'll let the strengths of
our ace carry us to victory.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.610
From now on, be selfish.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.820
But...

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.530
The others will go along with it.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:59.920
Just like you, I did what he said
and became Japan's best.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:04.050
And yet, why is it?

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:11.050
Coach only sees you from back then.
"Minato would've made a better play."

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:15.850
"If Minato had practiced it,
that play would've worked."

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:21.020
I became the best without you,
and Coach won't acknowledge me!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:27.400
I'm my own person! I'm not your stand-in!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:34.080
I wanna crush you
to prove that I'm better.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:39.210
I'm glad your memory's back.
Now you can play at your best.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.290
I guess you win.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.210
Huh?

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:47.130
By default. I quit water polo.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.130
Running away?!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.220
I can't play at Yamanami!

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:55.720
I'm serious about water polo,
so I can't stand people who aren't!

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:26.130
It's sad, but this is the original Minato.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:30.130
Is the kind Minato gone for good?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.010
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.390
Say it. We're all ears.

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:39.600
You can write pretty? That's cool!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.480
He was a good guy.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.900
Yeah.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:54.740
I wonder which way he's happier.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.040
The other Big Bro seemed
cheerful and happy.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:08.130
He loved talking about water polo with us.
The old him never said a thing.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:14.340
I kinda think it's better if his
memory hadn't come back.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:19.390
There's no way that's better.
He's his old self again.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.770
Mmm.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.230
Sorry. That was a terrible thing to--

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.020
What the hell?!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:32.650
I've always been me! There is no other me!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.240
I'm quitting water polo,
so leave me alone!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.920
"The other Big Bro"? Gimme a break.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.850
To think I'm quitting water polo...

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:07.020
I always thought I'd
represent Japan someday.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.480
Dammit!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.160
"To Minato"

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.410
Look in your sneaker boxes.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.410
"Look in your sneaker boxes."

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:42.680
"This one"

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.030
Uh, um...

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:03.870
'Sup, Minato?! Uh,
that's weird to say out loud.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:07.080
Uh...

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:07.080
Is this... the old me?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:12.920
If there's another me watching
this, I was right to worry.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.130
"Worry"?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:21.340
The doctor says regaining my memories
shouldn't erase the new ones I've made,

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:23.850
but I still worry about it.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.980
I'm recording this right
after our training camp.

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:33.110
If this turns out to be all for nothing,
I'll be totally embarrassed.

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:38.820
But just to be safe, I'm leaving this
behind in case this "me" disappears.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.660
Um, where do I start?

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.660
It didn't happen as I thought,
but it still happened.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:48.870
Oh! First of all, I wanna talk
about the club members!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:55.340
After all, you're on a team of people
you don't know. Wild, right?

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.130
But try to work with 'em.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.800
Huh?

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:03.090
They're training hard every day.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:07.180
Since you were once the best,
they probably seem bad,

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.020
but they're serious about winning.

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.690
"Serious"...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:19.900
It'd be nice if I stay who I am and
we get our first win as a team together.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:27.290
But if I'm not myself anymore,
I ask that you make it come true! Please!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:33.790
Minato... The other me...

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.170
What's that? You'll do it?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.880
I said nothing.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.760
I'll introduce you to the guys, then!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:49.600
This blondie is our captain, Jo Jojima.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:54.690
From the top, it's Jojima Jo!
From the bottom, it's Jo Jimajo!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.320
Together now! Ready?

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:01.820
From the top, it's Jojima Jo!
From the bottom, it's--

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.900
To Minato

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.900
Look in your sneaker boxes.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:08.450
One, two! One, two!

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:12.080
I see. Guess it's time to give up.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.500
Yeah.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.170
Sorry I couldn't convince him.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.590
Don't say that.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.670
Yeah.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.800
The fake crying plan didn't work.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.350
Well, I lied about fake crying.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:31.220
Huh?

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:37.020
Everyone would've given up
on him unless I said something.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.070
The truth is, I can't fake cry.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:46.660
But when I faced him for real,
I couldn't stop the tears.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:56.670
Thanks for trying till the very end.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:01.300
Perhaps it's too soon to give up.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:10.470
Are you handing in your
resignation, Senpai?

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:15.810
No. I guess I'm playing
for the time being.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.350
Really?!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.480
This guy wouldn't leave me alone.

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.270
Senpai!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.780
The hell--?!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.990
I see! Thank you!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.830
Now we can play again.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.370
Nice! Let's get practicing!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.080
Before that...!

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:40.340
Care for some of these?

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:45.720
I made 'em in case the plan worked!
Today's have almonds!

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:47.880
Sounds good!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.300
Cut it out!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.100
Not before practice.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.930
Sorry.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.320
Here!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:17.330
First off, show me what you've got.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.380
Sorry.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.810
What was that?!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.520
You even trying?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.560
Huh?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.110
That goes for you, too.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:45.860
Sorry.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:49.110
You other guys are so-so.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:55.120
But you'll never beat Shogaku
playing like this.

00:16:55.120 --> 00:17:01.040
Watch closely and maybe you'll
learn enough to not hold me back.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.880
So arrogant.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.840
But if his memory's back,
maybe his talent is, too.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.840
Oh?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:19.770
You guys throw with nothing
but your upper body.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:26.230
Shooting takes footwork, too,
so make use of your lower half.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.940
Like this.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:37.870
Huh?

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:55.430
My body won't move how I want.
We can't win if I'm this weak.

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:59.850
We'll let the strengths of
our ace carry us to victory.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.520
It's no use.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.520
That was pathetic.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.360
Huh?

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.780
After all that big talk?

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.070
Shut up. Got a problem?

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.070
Nah, I'm relieved.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.030
Huh?

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:18.410
If you were too awesome,
you'd be less approachable.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.960
Ejiri's a super straightforward guy.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.090
That's Senpai for you! Nice shooting form!

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:30.800
Eitaro loves water polo more than anyone!

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.800
I see...

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:36.550
Footwork, huh? I'll give it a shot!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.760
I've only used my upper half.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:44.560
Babayaro and Ushimado are beginners,
but they're like the team mascots.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:48.400
Them trying hard gets everyone pumped up.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.700
I see. It feels different using your legs.

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:58.740
Amihama does things his own way.
Keep an eye on him.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:02.160
Dude, I thought you got another cramp!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.120
Huh?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:08.080
Captain's the mood maker.
He brings the team together.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:15.470
That takes me back.
At first, you sank like this.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.890
Oh, yeah.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.470
That's right.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.390
He sure did.

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:23.220
Teamwork is our best weapon.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:29.770
One person can't carry us to victory.
We're a team that works together.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.190
When you shoot, look a different way.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:35.740
--A different way?
--Are my passes hard to get?
--How about me?

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:43.410
That's bullshit. I'll show 'em I can win
with my strength alone.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.800
I'm quitting water polo,
so leave me alone!

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:57.300
Hold up! Stop!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.840
Kiyomizu!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.050
Sorry!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:03.100
One month till the competition! Focus!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.140
Right!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.220
Masterpeace

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.220
yen

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.890
Yes, of course.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:13.650
We'd appreciate it if you could deliver
before this time next month.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:14.650
Yes... Yeah, I understand.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:18.530
Yes... Yeah, I understand.

