00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.410
You're practicing again?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.670
Huh?

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.380
After that, I thought you'd
give up for good.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.420
Huh?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.130
Huh?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.380
How'd you know I go this way?

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.140
And after what?

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:43.970
Could it be... that you...?

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:51.060
I see. Your memory...

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.270
Yeah.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:56.400
So, the you before that
happened is gone now?

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.280
Seems that way.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.700
I see.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.620
What happened to our promise?

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:03.450
Huh?

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:07.250
Me becoming the best in Japan. I--

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.120
I kissed you already.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:09.960
Huh?

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.580
The other you.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.710
I'm shocked.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:17.460
Eh?

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:21.180
Your memory's back,
but you're playing at Yamanami.

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:22.930
I've got no choice.

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:29.480
I'm using them to show Shogaku
they made a mistake. That's all.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:36.150
You really did revert back.
I'm done dealing with you, then.

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.360
Huh?

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:46.530
The day you confessed, I told you:
I hate you because of Ichinose.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.710
Since I kept my promise, this is goodbye.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:57.380
I see.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:58.840
Assemble!

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.640
In a month, the battle leading
to Interhighs begins.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.680
What's our goal, Captain?

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:12.640
To win it again!

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:16.360
Correct. To be back-to-back champions.

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:17.440
Right!

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:21.150
We'll win again and show them
how fearsome we are!

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.360
Right!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:27.410
But for that, we have to attack
prefecturals with all we've got.

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:31.710
Let's head to Interhighs on
a winning streak. Understand?

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:33.160
Yeah!

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:38.880
<i>There's a me just like me at my side</i>

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:41.880
<i>Laughing</i>

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:49.470
<i>All the many sights and</i>

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>All the words you left behind</i>

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:59.730
<i>Are looking a little warped</i>

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:03.150
<i>Someone, anyone tell me</i>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>It hurts, it hurts, it hurts</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:14.460
<i>What am I suddenly crying for?</i>
